### Gerar Mega-Sena
GET http://localhost:8080/api/games/mega-sena

### Gerar Lotofácil
GET http://localhost:8080/api/games/lotofacil

### Histórico
GET http://localhost:8080/api/games/history

### Analisar jogo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/analysis
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lotteryType": "MEGA_SENA",
  "numbers": [4, 12, 23, 34, 47, 59]
}


### Importar últimos 200 concursos oficiais Mega-Sena
POST http://localhost:8080/api/import/MEGA_SENA?quantity=200

### Importar últimos 200 concursos oficiais Lotofácil
POST http://localhost:8080/api/import/LOTOFACIL?quantity=200

### Estatísticas reais Mega-Sena
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stats/MEGA_SENA

### Gerador Smart - testa 1000 candidatos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/smart-generator/MEGA_SENA?candidates=1000


### SmartScore 2.0
POST http://localhost:8080/api/smart-analysis
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lotteryType": "MEGA_SENA",
  "numbers": [4, 12, 23, 34, 47, 59]
}

### Backtest últimos 30 concursos usando 200 candidatos por teste
GET http://localhost:8080/api/backtest/MEGA_SENA?tests=30&candidates=200

### Backtest Lotofácil
GET http://localhost:8080/api/backtest/LOTOFACIL?tests=30&candidates=200


### Comparar SmartLoto vs Aleatório
GET http://localhost:8080/api/strategy-comparison/MEGA_SENA?tests=30&candidates=200


### Cadastro
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":"Vinicius",
  "email":"vinicius@example.com",
  "password":"senha-de-exemplo"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email":"vinicius@example.com",
  "password":"senha-de-exemplo"
}


### LOGIN ADMIN (habilite e defina a senha no .env)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email":"admin@smartloto.local",
  "password":"SENHA_DEFINIDA_NO_ENV"
}

### PERFIL (substitua TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### IMPORT ADMIN (substitua TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/import/MEGA_SENA?quantity=200
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### RANKING (substitua TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/saved-games/ranking
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
